# one connected, which it otherwise skips, and no solo bot match, King of the
# Hill, troopers, jungle camps or practice bots start, nor does a player
# start on a zipline. A mode applies it with its own settings after it:
#
#   console.apply({**console.ARENA, "citadel_allow_duplicate_heroes": True})
